<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Tongkah year net up 34.2 pct. [CORRECTED]</title>
<headline>Malaysia Tongkah year net up 34.2 pct. [CORRECTED]</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects headline from &quot;year net down 13 pct.&quot;)</p>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group shr  (cents)	18.22   vs	15.98</p>
<p>    Net profit		  25.01   vs	18.63</p>
<p>    Turnover		   528.08   vs     453.85</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    44.41   vs	27.15</p>
<p>    Minorities	 less    0.29   vs	  -</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	    4.05   vs less  1.07</p>
<p>    Dividend			-     vs	  -</p>
<p>Note - Full name of the company is Tongkah Holdings Bhd. It is involved in seismic data processing, plastic injection moulding and property development.</p>
<p>- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
